$bog_microtodo_row $mol_view
	link \
	list_title \
	myday false
	arg *
	attr *
		^
		bog_microtodo_row_done <= done? false
		bog_microtodo_row_overdue <= overdue false
	sub /
		<= Done $mol_check_box
			hint @ \Отметить как выполненное
			checked? <=> done?
		<= Open $mol_link
			arg <= arg
			sub /
				<= Title $mol_view
					sub /
						<= title \
				<= Meta $mol_view
					sub <= meta /
						<= Meta_text $mol_view
							sub /
								<= meta_text \
		<= Important $bog_microtodo_star
			checked? <=> important? false
